    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a new manager here and just trying to get my head around the company protocols. Can you give me a quick summary of how a typical three-step progressive discipline process works? I want to make sure I'm handling things fairly and documenting everything correctly if an employee isn't meeting expectations.",
